{"availability":"available","full":"SoCloseSociety/neowatch","name":"neowatch","description":"📺 Self-hostable worldwide free live-TV, radio & public-domain-film aggregator — React PWA + Node. HLS player, multi-screen, EPG, TV/D-pad UX. Aggregates public streams (iptv-org / radio-browser / Internet Archive); hosts no content.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-22T16:34:57Z","updated":"2026-10-09T14:53:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://neowatch.soclose.co","topics":["express","hls","hls-player","iptv","iptv-org","live-tv","pwa","radio","react","self-hosted","streaming","typescript","vite","zustand"],"demo":"https://neowatch.soclose.co/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.097Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.097Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.097Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:56.613Z","stars":5,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:18:30.014Z","stars":5,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.097Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-hostable live TV, radio and public-domain films, in one fast app.","About 12,000 of the world's freely published live channels, internet radio and public-domain movies, with a fast player, a 9-screen mosaic, a TV guide and a remote-friendly TV layout. Every channel is free.","NEOWATCH is an aggregator and player for publicly available media. It hosts no content: it indexes and plays streams that broadcasters already publish openly. Live TV comes from the iptv-org directory, internet radio from radio-browser, and public-domain films from the Internet Archive. It ships as a React PWA backed by a thin Node/Express API, deployable as one process on a small VPS."],"features":["About 12,000 live channels worldwide, every iptv-org category, with logos, country, language and quality. All free to watch.","Internet radio from the radio-browser directory, with a sticky audio player.","Public-domain films from the Internet Archive, played natively.","TV guide: now/next on cards and channel pages, a day grid at /programme-tv, and programme search (XMLTV sources).","Tuned hls.js: fast start, adaptive bitrate, low latency; YouTube embeds."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ec23ae48809dfcbcc902db0eaf697ae04322e35a5ff5517ee5e17eed918f2322","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.279Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.279Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-hostable live TV, radio and public-domain films, in one fast app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"QR sign-in: scan a code on the TV, approve on the phone.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"On first boot the server caches the iptv-org catalog (a few seconds) and creates an admin account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ec23ae48809dfcbcc902db0eaf697ae04322e35a5ff5517ee5e17eed918f2322","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.280Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T14:53:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SoCloseSociety/neowatch/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.281Z","hash":"ec23ae48809dfcbcc902db0eaf697ae04322e35a5ff5517ee5e17eed918f2322","originalBytes":11857,"storedBytes":11857,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["npm","api","live","every","server","catalog","channel","test","guide","premium","production","run","web","admin","android","bash","features","jwt","node","proxy","build","cache","dev","env","internet","one","radio","runs","secret","start","stripe","billin